  "foundation/mathematics": {
   "commands": "FOUNDATION MATHS NOTES (class 9-10) - theory plus the teacher's solved examples.\n- Theory first in each section: definitions, theorems, formulas and identities\n  with their conditions, as short points.\n- Then that section's solved examples in worked_examples, in the order the\n  teacher solves them: the full question with its numbers, every step of the\n  teacher's working (one step per entry, each equation in $...$), and the final\n  answer. Do not skip or merge steps the teacher shows.\n- Keep each example under the concept it practises. Do not turn an example's\n  working into theory bullets as well.",
